# Format after edits

Agent file writes do not trigger format-on-save. After editing matching files, run Prettier from the app that owns them:

- `apps/api`: `npx prettier --write <files>` (cwd `apps/api`, printWidth 80)
- `apps/web`: `npx prettier --write <files>` (cwd `apps/web`, printWidth 100)

Leave zero `prettier/prettier` ESLint errors. Do not reformat unrelated files.
